ighlights how cultural and gender roles can influence behavior within a social setting like a fraternity house. The contrast between the two frat boys' roles and the subsequent interaction with law enforcement provides a lens through which to view how societal expectations and cultural backgrounds intersect in real-life situations.\n<|im_end|>"}
