 **Moral Development Stage**: The stage of moral development a person is in can also influence their values. someone in a more advanced stage of moral development might adopt more nuanced and complex ethical perspectives, while someone earlier in their development might rely on simpler, more black-and-white moral frameworks.\n\nThese factors interconnect to create a unique moral framework for each individual, even when they share similar upbringings."}
