cts. This shows how beliefs and practices can coexist and influence each other, providing a unique way for individuals to cope with loss.\n\nIn summary, cultural practices and personal beliefs interplay in complex ways when it comes to death and dying. They can shape how communities approach mortality, how individuals cope with loss, and"}
